    # na "And how do we know you’re not going to do that to us?"
    na "那我们怎么知道你就不会对我们做同样的事？"

# game/chapters/chapter_one_one/chapter_one_one.rpy:820
translate schinese why_you_here_label_eb1930dd_1:

    # rav "Hmmm… I guess there’s no way of finding out."
    rav "唔……我想也没法确认。"

# game/chapters/chapter_one_one/chapter_one_one.rpy:823
translate schinese why_you_here_label_b55429dc_1:

